{"title":"Elder Basilisk","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 36 Basilisk that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 5 times (8.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/elder-basilisk\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/elder-basilisk?lv=34\">Lv 34 <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/elder-basilisk?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>35</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/elder-basilisk?lv=36\">Lv 36 <span>26</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/elder-basilisk?lv=34\" title=\"Pick level 34\"><td><b>34</b></td><td>145</td><td>23.2</td><td>1,700</td><td class=\"muted\">435 · 32.5 · 5,100</td><td>10</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Boneyard%20Roost\">Boneyard Roost</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/elder-basilisk?lv=35\" title=\"Pick level 35\"><td><b>35</b></td><td>152</td><td>23.8</td><td>1,750</td><td class=\"muted\">456 · 33.3 · 5,250</td><td>35</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Boneyard%20Roost\">Boneyard Roost</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/elder-basilisk\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>36</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>160</td><td>24.3</td><td>1,800</td><td class=\"muted\">480 · 34 · 5,400</td><td>26</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"elder-basilisk\" data-map-level=\"36\">Show level 36 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 20 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"basilisk-scale\" title=\"Basilisk Scale - in 18 of 20 looted corpses, 15 recorded drops, 22 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a5ed9e1dc0e4fec30424.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Basilisk Scale</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.1<br>×1–3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"basilisk-hide\" title=\"Basilisk Hide - in 14 of 20 looted corpses, 11 recorded drops, 15 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/92ba5da9ce736ad2f55e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Basilisk Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.4<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 9 recorded drops, 496 total, 22–118 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×22–118</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 3 of 20 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-torso\" title=\"Gold Torso - in 1 of 20 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e7cc2b2b975d3b90d517.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/20<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"petrified-eye\" title=\"Petrified Eye - in 1 of 20 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/8ae52230f75f93b21c7e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Petrified Eye</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/20<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"basilisk-hide\" title=\"Basilisk Hide - in 14 of 20 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 8 total, 1–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/92ba5da9ce736ad2f55e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Basilisk Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.4<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"basilisk-scale\" title=\"Basilisk Scale - in 18 of 20 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 6 total, 1–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a5ed9e1dc0e4fec30424.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Basilisk Scale</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.1<br>×1–4</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-385.1px,-779.9px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:768px\"><i style=\"left:268.9px;top:775.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:371.2px;top:833.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:363.7px;top:723.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:540.4px;top:780.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:304.6px;top:750.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:374.0px;top:824.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:353.4px;top:815.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:338.2px;top:780.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:411.1px;top:771.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:373.3px;top:828.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:342.4px;top:729.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:383.6px;top:769.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:349.3px;top:760.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:288.8px;top:782.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:393.3px;top:848.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:351.3px;top:715.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:286.0px;top:740.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:282.6px;top:751.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:263.3px;top:733.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:310.0px;top:751.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:367.8px;top:719.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:458.6px;top:845.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:464.8px;top:840.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:301.1px;top:753.8px\"></i></div><figcaption>Old Thak Muster Ground</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 22 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/ma